.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH orbit-show 1  "show " 
.SH NAME
orbit\-show \- Show one task
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit show\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIR\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show one task
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object per result, with `"v":1`, instead of text
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable ANSI colors
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIR\fR>

.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  orbit show 1
  orbit show 3f2b9c
  orbit show buy milk
  orbit \-\-json show 1
